{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["people_table:read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"description":"Describe a job\u2019s People table for this key (people_table.describe): every column with its exposure, capabilities and filter operators, the limits, the saved views (no config) and the stage counts over eligible people. Call it before opentrain_people_table_query. Columns are addressed by id (country, custom:<fieldId>). Contact, financial and compliance columns are redacted for API keys and read exactly like unknown columns (COLUMN_NOT_QUERYABLE); Project To-do columns also need project_todos:read and Screening lms:read; candidate-written text (profile title, city, skills and other tag lists) is scrubbed of contact data and the surname and is selectable only. Names are masked \"First L.\"; address a person by jobPersonId. Banned, closed and non-visible candidates never appear in rows, counts or facets. Reads spend the key\u2019s budget (120 requests a minute and 50,000 rows an hour across jobs and surfaces); a spent budget is a 429 RATE_LIMITED with a retry delay. Requires people_table:read.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"jobId":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[!-~]+$","type":"string"}},"required":["jobId"],"type":"object"},"name":"opentrain_people_table_describe","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"apiBaseUrl":{"type":"string"},"result":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"capabilities":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"agentNotes":{"type":"boolean"},"canWrite":{"type":"boolean"},"projectTodoColumns":{"type":"boolean"},"screeningColumn":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["canWrite","agentNotes","projectTodoColumns","screeningColumn"],"type":"object"},"columns":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"access":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["full","p